{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-00622-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":4,"utility":2,"evidence":["빅뱅이 4월 10일과 17일 두 차례 미국 음악축제 ‘코첼라 ... 출연한다","포스터 ... ‘빅뱅(BIGBANG)’ 부분을 빨간색 네모로 강조했다"],"reason":"The summary says YG Entertainment appears at the festival and that Bigbang has already resumed activity. The source says Bigbang will perform, so the entity and tense are wrong. It also says Yang emphasized the members' activities, when the source only says he highlighted the Bigbang name on the poster. It omits the 4-member lineup, the three-year gap and the investigation outcomes, and the mention of Daesung's exoneration lacks context."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":5,"utility":3,"evidence":["4인조(탑, 태양, 지드래곤, 대성)로 재편됐지만 탑이 입대한 2017년 이후 3년 만에","양 전 대표가 SNS 활동을 한 것은 지난해 3월 이후 처음이다"],"reason":"The summary accurately keeps the dates, the 4-member lineup, the 3-year gap and Yang's Instagram post. It omits why activity resumed (the investigations being wrapped up) and the Yang gambling probe. It also drops the qualifier '사실상' before '완전체'. It says YG Entertainment's Bigbang, which is acceptable."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["YG엔터테인먼트가 ... 출연한다","양 전 대표는 성매매 알선 혐의 등에 연루돼 지난해 6월 사퇴","수사가 대부분 마무리되면서"],"reason":"The summary makes YG Entertainment the performer instead of Bigbang. The phrase '수사 중인 각종 수사가 마무리' is contradictory and drops '대부분'. It also omits that the gambling probe is still ongoing, and the claim that Yang emphasized Bigbang's activities is a mild distortion of the poster highlight. The Yang resignation and prosecutors' decision are accurate."},"D":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":5,"utility":3,"evidence":["빅뱅이 4월 10일과 17일 두 차례 미국 음악축제","4인조(탑, 태양, 지드래곤, 대성)로 재편"],"reason":"The summary says YG Entertainment, not Bigbang, appears at the festival, which is a subject error, although the next sentence makes clear that it means Bigbang. The lineup, the dates, the three-year gap and the poster post are accurate. It omits the background on the investigations and Yang's earlier social media silence."}}}
